{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","翱翔天际的白银之翼"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","天翔ける白銀の翼"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","玛露西尔的所有技能均需要吟唱施法。主动使用时持续施法召唤天空鱼攻击敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","マルシルのスキル発動にはすべて詠唱が必要。アクティブ効果：持続的に魔法を発動し、スカイフィッシュを召喚して敵を攻撃"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，自身的各项技能均需要消耗时间吟唱施法，但玛露西尔会不间断地尝试释放各项技能，且其吟唱速度会受到急速和攻击速度的共同影响。每当玛露西尔成功地完成一次吟唱，便会永久提高自身10点急速与5%能量恢复速度，最多叠加10次。\n主动使用时，立即扣除200点魔法值，并且每秒持续消耗80法力值吟唱施法，召唤天空鱼在场上冲刺，每次攻击会对一条路径上的所有敌人造成500% + 50% ATK伤害。天空鱼冲刺的基础吟唱频率为每2秒一次。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：マルシルの各スキルの発動には詠唱が必要。マルシルは持続的に各スキルを発動しようとする。詠唱速度は、速度と攻撃速度の影響を受ける。詠唱が完了するたびに、永続的にマルシルの速度+10、SP回復効率+5%、最大10回まで重複可能\nアクティブ効果：200SPを消費して詠唱を開始。詠唱期間中、毎秒80SPを消費して、フィールド上で突進するスカイフィッシュを召喚し、維持する。スカイフィッシュが攻撃するたびに、1つの経路上の敵に500% + 50% ATKのダメージを与える。スカイフィッシュの突進の基礎詠唱頻度は2秒に1回"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":181,"end":187,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":220,"end":226,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":177,"end":191,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":216,"end":230,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","スカイフィッシュのダメージが520% + 50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至530% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","スカイフィッシュのダメージが530% + 50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至540% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","スカイフィッシュのダメージが540% + 50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","天空鱼造成的伤害提升至550% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","スカイフィッシュのダメージが550% + 50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","爆炸魔法"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","爆発魔法"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱一段时间后，释放爆炸魔法对一片范围内的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","一定時間の詠唱後、爆発魔法を発動し、範囲内の敵にダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","吟唱3秒后，在敌方最密集区域施放爆炸魔法，对半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成300% + 40% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","3秒間の詠唱後、敵が最も密集しているエリアに爆発魔法を放ち、半径1マス以内の敵に300% + 40% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":40,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至330% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが330% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至370% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが370% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが400% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","闪光魔法"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","閃光魔術"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱一段时间后，释放闪光魔法，对一名友军产生治疗，伤害并致盲其附近的敌人。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","一定時間の詠唱後、閃光魔術を発動し、味方1体を回復し、その近くにいる敵にダメージを与え、暗闇を付与"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","吟唱2秒后，在一名身边有敌人的友军身边产生耀眼的光芒，为其恢复300% + 30% ATK生命值，并对周围所有敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害并使其致盲，持续4 + 0.4秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","2秒間の詠唱後、近くに敵がいる味方1体の隣に強烈な光を放ち、対象の味方のHPを300% + 30% ATK回復し、周囲の敵全体に240% + 30% ATKにダメージを与え、4 + 0.4秒間の暗闇を付与"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":63,"end":69,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":84,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":68,"end":74,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":88,"end":94,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":59,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":64,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが260% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが280% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが300% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升急速。终极技能吟唱期间额外提升急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、速度UP。必殺技の詠唱期間中、追加で速度UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔提升10点急速。在终极技能吟唱期间，额外提升6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、マルシルの速度+10。必殺技の詠唱期間中、追加でマルシルの速度+6"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔提升14点急速。在终极技能吟唱期间，额外提升7点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、マルシルの速度+14。必殺技の詠唱期間中、追加でマルシルの速度+7"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔提升18点急速。在终极技能吟唱期间，额外提升8点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、マルシルの速度+18。必殺技の詠唱期間中、追加でマルシルの速度+8"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","禁忌的古代魔法"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","禁忌の古代魔術"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱一段时间后，施法古代魔法，复活一名友方英雄。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","一定時間の詠唱後、古代魔術を発動し、味方英雄1体を復活"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在脚下生成古代魔法阵。吟唱3秒后，复活一名友方英雄，并使其恢复400% ATK生命值，每场战斗最多只能成功释放1次。布阵时，若自己身前1格处有友军，则本技能只会选择该友军为目标。若己方上阵了莱欧斯，则本技能可以额外复活一次莱欧斯（无需满足站位条件、且不消耗本技能的使用次数），但每场战斗最多只能触发1次。若本技能在吟唱过程中被打断，则后续5秒内无法再次释放。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","足元に古代魔術の魔法陣を生成し、3秒間の詠唱後、味方英雄1体を復活させ、HPを400% ATK回復。この魔術は1度の戦闘につき、1回しか発動できない。英雄配置時、マルシルの前方1マスに味方が配置されている場合、このスキルはその味方のみを対象に選択。出撃中の味方にライオスがいる場合、このスキルでライオスを1回復活することが可能（配置条件無視、スキル発動回数にカウントされない）。ライオスの復活は、1度の戦闘につき1回しかできない。詠唱中に中断された場合、5秒間、このスキルを発動できない"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":39,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","被复活的友方英雄生命值恢复提高至450% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","味方英雄復活時のHP回復量が450% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","本技能吟唱期间，古代魔法阵每秒会对场上所有敌人造成250% ATK伤害，并吸收伤害量的100%，将这部分数值增加至复活目标的生命恢复量当中。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","このスキルの詠唱期間中、古代魔術の魔法陣は毎秒、フィールド上の敵全体に250% ATKダメージを与え、ダメージ量の100%を吸収。吸収したHPを味方復活時のHP回復量に加算"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","被复活的友方英雄生命值恢复提高至500% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","味方英雄復活時のHP回復量が500% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","玛露西尔拥有来自其他友军的属性提升效果时，每秒可额外恢复能量。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","マルシルが他の味方によるステータス上昇効果を受けている場合、毎秒、追加でSPを回復"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，玛露西尔当前每拥有一个来自不同友军的属性提升效果，每秒便会额外恢复10点能量，该效果最多同时叠加3层。当拥有3层该效果时，玛露西尔获得霸体。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、マルシルに付与されている「異なる味方によるステータス上昇効果」1つにつき、毎秒、追加でSPを10回復。この効果は最大3スタックまで重複可能。この効果が3スタックに達している場合、マルシルはスーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":98,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","安布罗希亚"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","アンブロシア"]]}